---
description: Start in poteto-mode and attach the Neon Tac verify report
alwaysApply: true
---

Every change in this repo starts in `/poteto-mode`.

Run `.cursor/skills/verify-tic-tac-toe/SKILL.md` before you finish a change. The command is `npm run verify`.

Attach that command's per-criterion report to the pull request description.

Do not edit `index.html`, `css/`, `js/`, `fonts/`, `icons/`, `manifest.webmanifest`, or the existing files in `test/` to make a seed or a test hook. Stub `Math.random` from the test.
